# The build context.
#
# `target/` is gigabytes and the image builds its own; `.env` carries
# credentials and must never end up in a layer.
#
# Everything the build actually needs is source, `Cargo.*`, `migrations/`,
# `modules/*/schema/*.sql` (embedded by `include_str!`) and `.sqlx/` — so this
# list stays deliberately short rather than trying to be an allow-list.
target
.git
.env
.env.*
docker/pgdata
